# Must be **/ — a bare *.tsbuildinfo matches only the root level, so nested
# build-info files would be copied in. TypeScript then reads the HOST's stale
# incremental state, concludes everything is up to date and emits nothing,
# while dist is (correctly) excluded. The image builds clean and ships empty.
